# Run, jump, and press E in the air: the board goes under the feet mid-air (a THUG caveman) and
# you land rolling, tricks and grinds open in the air.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -12 0.13 90
tap walk 10
hold up 20..120
tap ollie 120
tap walk 135
run 260
expect event boardDrop{air=true} within 135..137
expect state air at 140
expect event land{quality=clean} within 160..215
expect state ground at end
expect skater.speed > 3 at end
